    {"enh_id": "EN_MAGNET", "legacy_no": 6, "name": "磁性", "text": "抽到它时，抽牌堆里如果还有另一张磁性牌，就把它也抽上来。被抽上来的那张不会继续抽。", "valid_card_kinds": ["NUM", "OP"], "family_id": "MAGNET", "handler_id": "EN_MAGNET", "hooks": ["ON_DRAW"], "params": {"extra_draw": 1, "chain_depth": 1}, "slot_cost": 1, "max_stacks": 1, "power_score": 1, "risk_kind": "BOON", "description_key": "DESC_EN_MAGNET"},
    {"enh_id": "EN_YINYANG", "legacy_no": 7, "name": "阴阳", "text": "同一条算式里至少有两张阴阳牌时，伤害变成两倍。", "valid_card_kinds": ["NUM", "OP"], "family_id": "YINYANG", "handler_id": "EN_YINYANG", "hooks": ["EQUATION"], "params": {"distinct_cards": 2, "damage_mult": 2.0}, "slot_cost": 1, "max_stacks": 1, "power_score": 2, "risk_kind": "BOON", "description_key": "DESC_EN_YINYANG"},
    {"enh_id": "EN_FLAMMABLE", "legacy_no": 10, "name": "易燃物质", "text": "牌面不动。这条算式乘法更多时临时加 5，加法更多时临时减 3。一样多就看最右边的符号。", "valid_card_kinds": ["NUM"], "family_id": "FLAMMABLE", "handler_id": "EN_FLAMMABLE", "hooks": ["OPERAND"], "params": {"mul_add": 5, "add_add": -3}, "slot_cost": 1, "max_stacks": 1, "power_score": 1, "risk_kind": "RISK", "description_key": "DESC_EN_FLAMMABLE"},
    {"enh_id": "EN_SMOLDER", "legacy_no": 11, "name": "焖烧", "text": "这局第一次拿去烧掉回血时，血会回，牌还留在手里。", "valid_card_kinds": ["NUM"], "family_id": "SMOLDER", "handler_id": "EN_SMOLDER", "hooks": ["ON_BURN"], "params": {"uses_per_run": 1}, "slot_cost": 1, "max_stacks": 1, "power_score": 1, "risk_kind": "BOON", "description_key": "DESC_EN_SMOLDER"},
